title: Charli
---
Charli: WHOA! Someone bounced into my castle! What brings you here? #line:0e7faf1 
-> I've got an invitation for you! #line:01d77ec 
    Charli: An invitation?  #line:0bc1fed 
    -> It's a party! All the monsters are invited. #line:0792d0d 
        Charli: Whoooooa YES!! But wait... my sky is so empty. My hot air balloons are all grounded! #line:0aeeee9 
        -> I'll help you! #line:05f13e8 
            Charli: I've got fire, you've got legs, let's make this work. #line:00efc24 
            Charli: I hereby lend you my fire power! #line:022d218 
            <<start_quest "Hot air balloon quest">>
-> I just wanted to ask about your castle! #line:0133a0a 
    Charli: BOUNCY, right? I slime up the walls so it gets extra squish! #line:08bd869 
    Charli: But without balloons floating around, it's like... only *half* bouncy. #line:03a3f7a 
    -> What happened to the balloons? #line:09df09d 
        Charli: They got sleepy. Cold. They need some fire... maybe from my favorite firefriend? #line:06a9f7f 
        -> I'll help you! #line:01afb24 
            Charli: I've got fire, you've got legs, let's make this work. #line:0fae319 
            Charli: I hereby lend you my fire power! #line:080120c 
            -> I brought you an invitation too! #line:032e6e6 
                Charli: Fire up those balloons and I'm *so* there. #line:0ff0623 
                <<start_quest "Hot air balloon quest">>
-> Sorry, I think I'm lost. #line:0e9cbec 
    Charli: That makes two of us! I always get lost when I don't leave any slime behind. #line:08945d0 
